{"title":"Research","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"Research","format":"html","editor":"source"},"headingText":"Publications","headingAttr":{"id":"publications","classes":[],"keyvalue":[]},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n::: research-lead\nMy work sits at the intersection of psychiatry, sociology, and genetics.\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"theme-grid\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"theme-card\" data-filter=\"social\">\n<span class=\"theme-num\">01</span>\n<span class=\"theme-title\">Social connection</span>\n<span class=\"theme-desc\">How social isolation and loneliness develop from childhood into adulthood, and how they intertwine with mental health.</span>\n<span class=\"theme-cta\">See related papers &darr;</span>\n</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"theme-card\" data-filter=\"depression\">\n<span class=\"theme-num\">02</span>\n<span class=\"theme-title\">Depression risk and presentation</span>\n<span class=\"theme-desc\">Why depression looks different across age and sex, and how social, environmental, and genetic risk factors combine to shape symptoms across the life course.</span>\n<span class=\"theme-cta\">See related papers &darr;</span>\n</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"theme-card\" data-filter=\"genetics\">\n<span class=\"theme-num\">03</span>\n<span class=\"theme-title\">Genetics and society</span>\n<span class=\"theme-desc\">Bringing social science and genomics together responsibly.</span>\n<span class=\"theme-cta\">See related papers &darr;</span>\n</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"theme-card\" data-filter=\"disparities\">\n<span class=\"theme-num\">04</span>\n<span class=\"theme-title\">Disparities in mental health</span>\n<span class=\"theme-desc\">Understanding and reducing inequalities in mental health using existing longitudinal cohort data.</span>\n<span class=\"theme-cta\">See related papers &darr;</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n```\n\n\n::: pub-intro\nCommitted to open and reproducible science: pre-registrations on [Open Science Framework](https://osf.io/r58nz/) and code on [GitHub](https://github.com/knthompson26). Full list on [Google Scholar](https://scholar.google.co.uk/citations?user=xD4dn1IAAAAJ&hl=en). † joint first author.\n:::\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"pub-filters\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter publications by theme\">\n<span class=\"pub-filters-label\">Filter:</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pub-filter is-active\" data-filter=\"all\">All</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pub-filter\" data-filter=\"social\">Social connection</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pub-filter\" data-filter=\"depression\">Depression</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pub-filter\" data-filter=\"genetics\">Genetics &amp; society</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pub-filter\" data-filter=\"disparities\">Disparities</button>\n</div>\n```\n\n::: pub-group\n### In press\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"social disparities depression\">\n<div class=\"pub-cover pub-cover--empty\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Preprint</div>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.31234/osf.io/j5drc_v1\">Social connection can mitigate depression risk</a></p>\n<p class=\"pub-meta\"><strong>Thompson, K. N.</strong> et al. (2026). <em>Nature Human Behaviour (in press)</em>.</p>\n<p class=\"pub-links\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.31234/osf.io/j5drc_v1\">Preprint &rarr;</a><span class=\"pub-tag\">Social connection</span><span class=\"pub-tag\">Disparities</span><span class=\"pub-tag\">Depression</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"depression genetics\">\n<div class=\"pub-cover pub-cover--empty\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Preprint</div>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.09.26.25335972\">Transancestry GWAS of adolescent-onset depression</a></p>\n<p class=\"pub-meta\">Grimes, P. et al. (2026). <em>Nature Genetics (in press)</em>.</p>\n<p class=\"pub-links\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.09.26.25335972\">Preprint &rarr;</a><span class=\"pub-tag\">Depression</span><span class=\"pub-tag\">Genetics &amp; society</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: pub-group\n### First author\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"depression\">\n<a class=\"pub-cover\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00127-026-03098-0\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"images/SPPE.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00127-026-03098-0\">Illuminating the complex interplay of risk factors for depression symptoms within a large-scale US longitudinal cohort</a></p>\n<p class=\"pub-meta\"><strong>Thompson, K. N.</strong> et al. (2026). <em>Social Psychiatry and Psychiatric Epidemiology</em>.</p>\n<p class=\"pub-links\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00127-026-03098-0\">Paper &rarr;</a><span class=\"pub-tag\">Depression</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"genetics\">\n<a class=\"pub-cover\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10519-026-10251-7\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"images/BG.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10519-026-10251-7\">Developing and teaching curriculum to reduce genetic essentialism in college classrooms</a></p>\n<p class=\"pub-meta\">Malerbi, K. F.†, Brubaker, A.†, Weindling, M.†, <strong>Thompson, K. N.</strong>† et al. (2026). <em>Behavior Genetics</em>.</p>\n<p class=\"pub-links\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10519-026-10251-7\">Paper &rarr;</a><span class=\"pub-tag\">Genetics &amp; society</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"social genetics\">\n<a class=\"pub-cover\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00787-024-02573-w\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"images/ECAP.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00787-024-02573-w\">The overlap between social isolation and mental health problems: a longitudinal behavioural genetic analysis in the E-Risk cohort</a></p>\n<p class=\"pub-meta\"><strong>Thompson, K. N.</strong> et al. (2025). <em>European Child &amp; Adolescent Psychiatry</em>.</p>\n<p class=\"pub-links\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00787-024-02573-w\">Paper &rarr;</a><span class=\"pub-tag\">Social connection</span><span class=\"pub-tag\">Genetics &amp; society</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"social\">\n<a class=\"pub-cover\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jaacop.2023.02.001\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"images/JAACAPO.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jaacop.2023.02.001\">Do children with attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder symptoms become socially isolated? Longitudinal within-person associations in a nationally representative cohort</a></p>\n<p class=\"pub-meta\"><strong>Thompson, K. N.</strong> et al. (2023). <em>JAACAP Open</em>. <span class=\"pub-note\"><span class=\"pub-award\">Editors’ Best Research Article 2023</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"pub-links\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jaacop.2023.02.001\">Paper &rarr;</a><span class=\"pub-tag\">Social connection</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"social\">\n<a class=\"pub-cover\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/jcv2.12073\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"images/JCPPA.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/jcv2.12073\">Trajectories of childhood social isolation in a nationally representative cohort: associations with antecedents and early adulthood outcomes</a></p>\n<p class=\"pub-meta\"><strong>Thompson, K. N.</strong> et al. (2022). <em>JCPP Advances</em>.</p>\n<p class=\"pub-links\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/jcv2.12073\">Paper &rarr;</a><span class=\"pub-tag\">Social connection</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"depression disparities\">\n<a class=\"pub-cover\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/da.23213\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"images/D&amp;A.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/da.23213\">Age and sex-related variability in the presentation of generalized anxiety and depression symptoms</a></p>\n<p class=\"pub-meta\"><strong>Thompson, K. N.</strong> et al. (2021). <em>Depression and Anxiety</em>.</p>\n<p class=\"pub-links\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/da.23213\">Paper &rarr;</a><span class=\"pub-tag\">Depression</span><span class=\"pub-tag\">Disparities</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: pub-group\n### Senior author\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"depression\">\n<a class=\"pub-cover\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ssmph.2025.101886\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"images/SSM.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ssmph.2025.101886\">What machine learning teaches us about depression prediction across the life course: an exploratory comparison of predictive models</a></p>\n<p class=\"pub-meta\">Geurgas, R. et al. (2025). <em>SSM – Population Health</em>.</p>\n<p class=\"pub-links\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ssmph.2025.101886\">Paper &rarr;</a><span class=\"pub-tag\">Depression</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: pub-group\n### Collaborations\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"collab-grid\"><a class=\"collab\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1017/S0954579426101758\">\n<img src=\"images/DevPsych.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Bryan, B. et al. (2026)</span><em>Development and Psychopathology</em></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"collab\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.xjmad.2026.100171\">\n<img src=\"images/JMAD.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Dunn, E. C. et al. (2026)</span><em>Journal of Mood and Anxiety Disorders</em></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"collab\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.xhgg.2025.100548\">\n<img src=\"images/HGG.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Wedow, R. et al. (2026)</span><em>Human Genetics and Genomics Advances</em></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"collab\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1017/S0033291725101037\">\n<img src=\"images/PsychMed.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Skelton, M. et al. (2025)</span><em>Psychological Medicine</em></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"collab\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jad.2025.04.010\">\n<img src=\"images/JAD.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Morneau-Vaillancourt, G. et al. (2025)</span><em>Journal of Affective Disorders</em></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"collab\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1037/dev0001788\">\n<img src=\"images/DevPsych2.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Thériault-Couture, F. et al. (2024)</span><em>Developmental Psychology</em></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"collab\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.socscimed.2024.116697\">\n<img src=\"images/SSMed.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Bryan, B. T. et al. (2024)</span><em>Social Science &amp; Medicine</em></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"collab\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1093/occmed/kqad138\">\n<img src=\"images/OccMed.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Bryan, B. T. et al. (2023)</span><em>Occupational Medicine</em></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"collab\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12888-023-04890-x\">\n<img src=\"images/BMCPsych.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Bright, S. J. et al. (2023)</span><em>BMC Psychiatry</em></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"collab\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1186/s12888-022-04275-6\">\n<img src=\"images/BMCPsych2.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Rayner, C. et al. (2022)</span><em>BMC Psychiatry</em></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"collab\" href=\"http://doi.org/10.1017/S0033291722002501\">\n<img src=\"images/PsychMed2.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Young, K. S. et al. (2022)</span><em>Psychological Medicine</em></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"collab\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.janxdis.2021.102491\">\n<img src=\"images/JAnxD.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Davies, M. R. et al. (2021)</span><em>Journal of Anxiety Disorders</em></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"collab\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1136/thoraxjnl-2021-217487\">\n<img src=\"images/Thorax.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Holt, H. et al. (2021)</span><em>Thorax</em></span>\n</a>\n<a class=\"collab\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jadr.2021.100201\">\n<img src=\"images/JADR.png\" alt=\"\">\n<span class=\"collab-meta\"><span class=\"collab-auth\">Peel, A. J. et al. (2021)</span><em>Journal of Affective Disorders Reports</em></span>\n</a></div>\n```\n\n:::\n\n```{=html}\n<script>\ndocument.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n  const pubs = document.querySelectorAll(\".pub[data-themes]\");\n  const btns = document.querySelectorAll(\".pub-filter\");\n  const sections = document.querySelectorAll(\".pub-group\");\n  function apply(f) {\n    btns.forEach(b => b.classList.toggle(\"is-active\", b.dataset.filter === f));\n    pubs.forEach(p => { p.hidden = !(f === \"all\" || p.dataset.themes.split(\" \").includes(f)); });\n    sections.forEach(s => {\n      const items = s.querySelectorAll(\".pub[data-themes]\");\n      if (items.length) s.hidden = [...items].every(p => p.hidden);\n      else s.hidden = f !== \"all\";\n    });\n  }\n  btns.forEach(b => b.addEventListener(\"click\", () => apply(b.dataset.filter)));\n  document.querySelectorAll(\".theme-card\").forEach(c => c.addEventListener(\"click\", () => {\n    apply(c.dataset.filter);\n    document.getElementById(\"publications\").scrollIntoView({behavior: \"smooth\"});\n  }));\n});\n</script>\n```\n\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n::: research-lead\nMy work sits at the intersection of psychiatry, sociology, and genetics.\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"theme-grid\">\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"theme-card\" data-filter=\"social\">\n<span class=\"theme-num\">01</span>\n<span class=\"theme-title\">Social connection</span>\n<span class=\"theme-desc\">How social isolation and loneliness develop from childhood into adulthood, and how they intertwine with mental health.</span>\n<span class=\"theme-cta\">See related papers &darr;</span>\n</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"theme-card\" data-filter=\"depression\">\n<span class=\"theme-num\">02</span>\n<span class=\"theme-title\">Depression risk and presentation</span>\n<span class=\"theme-desc\">Why depression looks different across age and sex, and how social, environmental, and genetic risk factors combine to shape symptoms across the life course.</span>\n<span class=\"theme-cta\">See related papers &darr;</span>\n</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"theme-card\" data-filter=\"genetics\">\n<span class=\"theme-num\">03</span>\n<span class=\"theme-title\">Genetics and society</span>\n<span class=\"theme-desc\">Bringing social science and genomics together responsibly.</span>\n<span class=\"theme-cta\">See related papers &darr;</span>\n</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"theme-card\" data-filter=\"disparities\">\n<span class=\"theme-num\">04</span>\n<span class=\"theme-title\">Disparities in mental health</span>\n<span class=\"theme-desc\">Understanding and reducing inequalities in mental health using existing longitudinal cohort data.</span>\n<span class=\"theme-cta\">See related papers &darr;</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Publications {#publications}\n\n::: pub-intro\nCommitted to open and reproducible science: pre-registrations on [Open Science Framework](https://osf.io/r58nz/) and code on [GitHub](https://github.com/knthompson26). Full list on [Google Scholar](https://scholar.google.co.uk/citations?user=xD4dn1IAAAAJ&hl=en). † joint first author.\n:::\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"pub-filters\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter publications by theme\">\n<span class=\"pub-filters-label\">Filter:</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pub-filter is-active\" data-filter=\"all\">All</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pub-filter\" data-filter=\"social\">Social connection</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pub-filter\" data-filter=\"depression\">Depression</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pub-filter\" data-filter=\"genetics\">Genetics &amp; society</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"pub-filter\" data-filter=\"disparities\">Disparities</button>\n</div>\n```\n\n::: pub-group\n### In press\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"social disparities depression\">\n<div class=\"pub-cover pub-cover--empty\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Preprint</div>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.31234/osf.io/j5drc_v1\">Social connection can mitigate depression risk</a></p>\n<p class=\"pub-meta\"><strong>Thompson, K. N.</strong> et al. (2026). <em>Nature Human Behaviour (in press)</em>.</p>\n<p class=\"pub-links\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.31234/osf.io/j5drc_v1\">Preprint &rarr;</a><span class=\"pub-tag\">Social connection</span><span class=\"pub-tag\">Disparities</span><span class=\"pub-tag\">Depression</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"depression genetics\">\n<div class=\"pub-cover pub-cover--empty\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Preprint</div>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.09.26.25335972\">Transancestry GWAS of adolescent-onset depression</a></p>\n<p class=\"pub-meta\">Grimes, P. et al. (2026). <em>Nature Genetics (in press)</em>.</p>\n<p class=\"pub-links\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.09.26.25335972\">Preprint &rarr;</a><span class=\"pub-tag\">Depression</span><span class=\"pub-tag\">Genetics &amp; society</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n\n::: pub-group\n### First author\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"depression\">\n<a class=\"pub-cover\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00127-026-03098-0\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"images/SPPE.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00127-026-03098-0\">Illuminating the complex interplay of risk factors for depression symptoms within a large-scale US longitudinal cohort</a></p>\n<p class=\"pub-meta\"><strong>Thompson, K. N.</strong> et al. (2026). <em>Social Psychiatry and Psychiatric Epidemiology</em>.</p>\n<p class=\"pub-links\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00127-026-03098-0\">Paper &rarr;</a><span class=\"pub-tag\">Depression</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"genetics\">\n<a class=\"pub-cover\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10519-026-10251-7\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"images/BG.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10519-026-10251-7\">Developing and teaching curriculum to reduce genetic essentialism in college classrooms</a></p>\n<p class=\"pub-meta\">Malerbi, K. F.†, Brubaker, A.†, Weindling, M.†, <strong>Thompson, K. N.</strong>† et al. (2026). <em>Behavior Genetics</em>.</p>\n<p class=\"pub-links\"><a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10519-026-10251-7\">Paper &rarr;</a><span class=\"pub-tag\">Genetics &amp; society</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pub\" data-themes=\"social genetics\">\n<a class=\"pub-cover\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00787-024-02573-w\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"images/ECAP.png\" alt=\"\"></a>\n<div class=\"pub-body\">\n<p class=\"pub-title\"><a href=\"https:/